  .string "{COLOR GREEN}Mega Manectric{COLOR BLUE} is a literal beast.\p"
  .string "It frightens foes with Intimidate,\n"
  .string "and threatens them out with its Speed\l"
  .string "and Special Attack.\p"
  .string "He's one of my favorites for a\n"
  .string "reason!$"


